      "side": 1,
      "message": "This question stems from my minimal compiler knowledge. I\u0027m assuming if compiling an mm file it will set OBJC and if it\u0027s a cpp file it will not be set. Is there any worry about building a whole project with a mix of mm and cpp files where this header (and specifically MtlTextureInfo) will get set differently?",
